   "source": [
    "# NNUE Trainer on Kaggle - Optimized for Maximum Elo\n",
    "\n",
    "Train a Stockfish-compatible NNUE network on Kaggle's free 2x T4 GPUs.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🚀 Optimizations Included\n",
    "- **Architecture**: FT(256 shared) → L1(256) → L2(32) → Out(1) — ~2.5M params\n",
    "- **Batch size**: 32,768 global (16,384 per GPU) for better gradient estimates\n",
    "- **LR Schedule**: Cosine with Warm Restarts (escapes local minima)\n",
    "- **Loss**: WDL(λ=0.55) + Huber Eval(δ=100) + Label Smoothing(0.05)\n",
    "- **Mixed Precision**: fp16 with proper GradScaler\n",
    "- **torch.compile**: PyTorch 2.0+ max-autotune mode\n",
    "- **Data**: 512MB shuffle buffer, 5-file round-robin streaming\n",
    "- **Checkpointing**: Every 15 min + HF upload (background, non-blocking)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Prerequisites\n",
    "1. **Kaggle account** with GPU quota enabled\n",
    "2. **Hugging Face account** with write token (for checkpoint uploads)\n",
    "3. **Fork this repository** to your GitHub (or use the original)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Setup (Run Once)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Step 1:** Add your HF token to Kaggle Secrets:\n",
    "- Click **Settings** (gear icon) → **Secrets** → **Add new secret**\n",
    "- Name: `HF_TOKEN`\n",
    "- Value: `hf_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx` (your HF write token)\n",
    "- Toggle **\"Secret\"** ON\n",
    "\n",
    "**Step 2:** Enable GPU:\n",
    "- Settings → **GPU** → **T4 x2** → **Save**\n",
    "\n",
    "## Run Training (3 Cells)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
