  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## After Training\n",
    "\n",
    "The trained network will be at:\n",
    "```\n",
    "/kaggle/working/export/nn-<hash>.nnue\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Download the net:\n",
    "1. Go to **Output** tab in Kaggle\n",
    "2. Navigate to `working/export/`\n",
    "3. Download `nn-<hash>.nnue`\n",
    "\n",
    "### Use with Stockfish:\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "# Build Stockfish (one-time)\n",
    "bash scripts/build_stockfish.sh\n",
    "\n",
    "# Test the net\n",
    "python scripts/test_uci.py --net /path/to/nn-<hash>.nnue\n",
    "\n",
    "# Play a game\n",
    "./stockfish\n",
    "UCI\n",
    "setoption name EvalFile value nn-<hash>.nnue\n",
    "isready\n",
    "go depth 20\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## Resume Training\n",
    "\n",
    "If the session dies or you need to continue:\n",
    "1. Re-run **Cell 3** (`!python run.py`)\n",
    "2. It will automatically:\n",
    "   - Download latest checkpoint from Hugging Face\n",
    "   - Restore exact training state (model, optimizer, data position, RNG)\n",
    "   - Continue training seamlessly\n",
    "\n",
    "## Expected Results (Optimized)\n",
    "\n",
    "| Metric | Target |\n",
    "|--------|--------|\n",
    "| Training time | ~9.5 hours (of 10h budget) |\n",
    "| Positions trained | ~50 billion |\n",
    "| Throughput | ~1.5M positions/sec (2x T4) |\n",
    "| Final net size | ~2.5M params → ~6 MB `.nnue` |\n",
    "| Strength gain | +80-150 Elo vs. baseline (est.) |\n",
    "\n",
    "## Troubleshooting\n",
    "\n",
    "| Issue | Solution |\n",
    "|-------|----------|\n",
    | \"No GPU\" | Settings → GPU → T4 x2 → Save, then **Restart Session** |\n",
    | \"Disk full\" | Reduce `max_data_gb` in `configs/train.yaml` |\n",
    | \"HF upload failed\" | Check HF_TOKEN in Secrets; uploads are non-blocking |\n",
    | \"OOM\" | Reduce `batch_size` in config (e.g., 16384) |\n",
    | \"Session killed\" | Re-run Cell 3; resumes from last checkpoint |\n",
    | \"C++ loader fails\" | Falls back to Python loader (slower but works) |\n",
    "\n",
    "## Advanced: Custom Config\n",
    "\n",
    "Modify `configs/train.yaml` before running Cell 3:\n",
    "```yaml\n",
    "training:\n",
    "  batch_size: 32768        # Reduce if OOM\n",
    "  learning_rate: 0.0012    # Peak LR\n",
    "  wdl_lambda: 0.55         # WDL weight\n",
    "  lr_schedule: cosine_warm_restarts\n",
    "  t0: 50000                # First restart\n",
    "\n",
    "time_budget:\n",
    "  hours: 10.0              # Total budget\n",
    "  checkpoint_interval_min: 15\n",
    "\n",
    "model:\n",
    "  hidden_sizes: [256, 32]  # L1, L2\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
